---
title: Sitewide UI Update
---

You may have noticed a few days ago that our website's UI has changed. Now we'd like to officially introduce the latest changes!

- All UI components have been redesigned. They now offer better performance while largely retaining their original visual style.
- A navigation bar has been added to the top of the page, making it clearer where you are in the page hierarchy.
- The "Expand Sidebar" button has been moved to the left side of the navigation bar.
- The "View Changelog" and "Change Language" buttons have been moved to the bottom of the sidebar.

In addition, we've introduced a new feature: when viewing multi-phase enemy data in Endgame, you can now view each phase's HP separately by simply clicking the HP value. For example, the King stage in "Anomaly Arbitration: Return of the Legion" already includes this new feature.
